# Frontend environment template. Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your own
# values. Never commit real credentials.
#
# Vite loads `.env.local` in every mode, and a production build runs
# mode=production, so `.env.local` (gitignored) outranks `.env` during
# `pnpm build` too. Keep a value that only a local dev server should see in
# `.env.local`, and a value the production bundle must carry in
# `.env.production` (gitignored).
#
# The bundle carries no payment credential: online payments run through
# Mollie's hosted checkout, which is a top-level navigation to the provider.
#
# Cloudflare Turnstile site key. Leave empty when Turnstile is not configured.
VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=
